Architecture Compliance Review:
- Conforms 100% to ADR 0035 and all 16 canonical GaxNet architecture specifications.
- Verified strict microkernel isolation: 0 network driver or protocol parsing code inside Ring-0 kernel.
- Verified Decoupled Ring-3 User-Space Stack Architecture:
  * virtio_net_server: Ring-3 VirtIO 1.2 PCI Express hardware driver implementing DeviceProvider.
  * net_stack_server: Ring-3 protocol stack implementing Ethernet, ARP cache (300s TTL), IPv4 router, ICMP echo, UDP, stateful TCP (3-way handshake, sliding window, NewReno congestion control), and NetNamespaceManager.
