  * crypto_server: Ring-3 session encryption service implementing CryptoProvider.
  * libgaxera::net: Native GaxNet client handles (NetSessionHandle, NetListenerHandle).
  * libgaxera::compat::sockets: POSIX BSD Sockets Virtualization Wrapper (BsdSocketTable).
